# CDN Guidelines

## Mục tiêu

Tài liệu này định nghĩa các nguyên tắc và best practices cho việc implement CDN (Content Delivery Network) trong Cursor Enterprise Framework. Mục tiêu là đảm bảo fast, reliable, và secure content delivery to users worldwide.

CDN giảm latency bằng cách cache và serve content từ edge locations gần users.

## Nguyên tắc cơ bản

### 1. CDN Architecture

Edge caching concepts.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     CDN Caching Layers                              │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                  │
│  User Request ──▶ CDN Edge ──▶ Origin Server                      │
│                       │                                          │
│                       ▼                                          │
│                 ┌───────────┐                                   │
│                 │   Cache   │                                   │
│                 │   HIT     │                                   │
│                 └───────────┘                                   │
│                       │                                          │
│                 ┌───────────┐                                   │
│                 │  Cache   │                                   │
│                 │  MISS    │                                   │
│                 └─────┬─────┘                                   │
│                       │                                          │
│                       ▼                                          │
│               Origin Server                                      │
│                                                                  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 2. Cache Headers

Proper caching configuration.

```yaml
# CloudFront cache behavior
cache_behavior:
  viewer_protocol_policy: redirect-to-https
  allowed_methods:
    - GET
    - HEAD
    - OPTIONS
  cached_methods:
    - GET
    - HEAD
  min_ttl: 0
  default_ttl: 3600      # 1 hour
  max_ttl: 86400        # 24 hours

  # Cache policy
  cache_policy_id: managed-caching-optimized

  # Origin request policy
  origin_request_policy_id: managed-allviewer

# Lambda@Edge for dynamic cache key
function:
  event_type: viewer-request
  function_arn: cache-key-function
```

### 3. Static Asset Caching

Optimize static content.

```yaml
# S3 + CloudFront configuration
s3_bucket:
  website:
    index_document: index.html
    error_document: error.html

  # Versioning for cache busting
  versioning:
    enabled: true

  # Lifecycle for cost optimization
  lifecycle_rules:
    - id: archive-logs
      status: enabled
      prefix: logs/
      expiration:
        days: 30

# CloudFront distribution
cloudfront:
  origins:
    - domain_name: bucket.s3.amazonaws.com
      custom_origin_config:
        origin_protocol_policy: https-only
      # OAI for security
      s3_origin_access_identity:
        enabled: true

  # Default root object
  default_root_object: index.html

  # Custom error pages
  custom_error_responses:
    - error_code: 404
      response_page_path: /404.html
      response_code: 404
      min_ttl: 0
```

### 4. Image Optimization

CDN for images.

```yaml
# CloudFront Function for image optimization
function viewer_request {
  // Add responsive image headers
}

# CloudFront Response Headers Policy
response_headers_policy:
  name: cache-security-headers
  custom_headers:
    - header: Cache-Control
      value: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
      override: true

    - header: ETag
      value: '"{{computed.etag}}"'
      override: true
```

